<title>ITALY: Mediobanca first half net profit seen up.</title>
<headline>Mediobanca first half net profit seen up.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian merchant bank Mediobanca - Banca di Credito Finanziario SpA raised its net profits by 10 to 15 percent in the first half of its current corporate year but saw its operating profit fall, board member Luigi Fausti said after a board meeting.</p>
<p>Fausti is also managing director of Banca Commerciale Italiana SpA.</p>
<p>Mediobanca ends its corporate year on June 30.</p>
<p>((--Milan Bureau 392 66129507))</p>
</text>
